{%- comment -%}
  Purpose-drawn icons for the homepage credibility band.

  Modular's icon set is generic commerce clip art — award, basket, calendar,
  dollar, fruits, wallet — with nothing for carbon fibre, a rotating mount head
  or a stake driven into turf. The band was using `award` (a trophy) for
  PREMIUM MATERIALS and `phone` for JUST STICK IT AND SWING IT, which is why
  the icons read as unrelated to the statements. No amount of re-picking fixes
  that, so these are drawn to the claims.

  Same construction as gpod-trust-icon: stroked, currentColor, 1.7 weight,
  24-unit box — so the proof band, the collection hero trust row and the PDP
  icons all read as one family.

  Accepts:
  - icon: {String} carbon | rotate | stake | magsafe | height | remote

  {%- render 'gpod-proof-icon', icon: block.settings.icon -%}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- case icon -%}
  {%- when 'carbon' -%}
    {%- comment -%} Tube cross-section with a carbon weave — material, not a trophy. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="10.5"/>
      <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="6"/>
      <path d="M11.8 11.8l8.4 8.4M20.2 11.8l-8.4 8.4"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'rotate' -%}
    {%- comment -%} Ball head with a full rotation arc and an arrowhead. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M25.5 16a9.5 9.5 0 1 1-3.6-7.4"/>
      <path d="M22.2 4.6v4.2h-4.2"/>
      <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="3.6"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'stake' -%}
    {%- comment -%} Shaft driven through a ground line, with the point below. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M16 4v18"/>
      <path d="M16 28l-2.4-4h4.8z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
      <path d="M5 22h22"/>
      <circle cx="16" cy="6.2" r="2.6"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'magsafe' -%}
    {%- comment -%} Magnetic puck meeting a phone plate. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <rect x="6.5" y="4.5" width="13" height="23" rx="3"/>
      <circle cx="13" cy="16" r="4.2"/>
      <path d="M23 12.5v7M26.5 14.5v3"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'height' -%}
    {%- comment -%} Telescoping shaft with travel arrows. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M16 6v20"/>
      <path d="M12 9.5l4-3.5 4 3.5M12 22.5l4 3.5 4-3.5"/>
      <path d="M9 16h14"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'remote' -%}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
      <rect x="11" y="4.5" width="10" height="23" rx="3.5"/>
      <circle cx="16" cy="11" r="2.2"/>
      <path d="M13.5 18h5M13.5 21.5h5"/>
    </svg>
{%- endcase -%}
